I've localized the issue to logf. 


To reproduce this: 

1. Checkout the [logf_error](https://github.com/bespoke-silicon-group/bsg_manycore/tree/logf_error) branch.
2. Build the toolchain from scratch (the branch includes the `--with-tune` flag above
3. Run the SPMD test software/spmd/float_logf (~10 seconds)
